@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Exportar Asignaturas (NestJS + Vue 3)

actor "Usuario (Docente)" as User
participant "AsignaturasView" as FE
participant "AsignaturasController" as Controller
participant "AsignaturasService" as Service
participant "PrismaService" as Prisma
participant "Base de Datos\n(SQLite/PostgreSQL)" as DB

User -> FE: Hace clic en\n"Exportar Asignaturas"
activate FE

FE -> Controller: GET /api/asignaturas
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: findAll()
activate Service

Service -> Prisma: asignatura.findMany()
activate Prisma
Prisma -> DB: SELECT * FROM Asignatura
activate DB
DB --> Prisma: asignaturas[]
deactivate DB
Prisma --> Service: asignaturas[]
deactivate Prisma

Service --> Controller: asignaturas[]
deactivate Service
Controller --> FE: 200 OK\nasignaturas[]
deactivate Controller

FE -> FE: Convierte datos a\nformato CSV/JSON\ny descarga archivo

FE --> User: Archivo descargado\n(CSV o JSON)
deactivate FE

@enduml
